hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1782","Narrated Jabir bin Mut'im (may Allah be pleased with him): I heard the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) reciting Surah At-Tur in the Maghrib prayer. When he reached this verse: ""Were they created by nothing, or were they themselves the creators? Or did they create the heavens and the earth? Nay, but they have no firm belief. Or are the treasures of your Lord with them, or are they the managers (of those treasures)?"" (Surah At-Tur: 35-37), it was as if my heart would fly away, i.e., burst out."
